/// Parses a string representing musical notes in a special ASCII format and returns
/// a list of integers corresponding to the duration of each note in beats.
///
/// Legend:
/// 'o' - whole note, lasts four beats
/// 'o|' - half note, lasts two beats
/// '.|' - quater note, lasts one beat
///
/// # Examples
///
/// ```
/// assert_eq!(parse_music("o o| .| o| o| .| .| .| .| o o"), vec![4, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 4, 4]);
/// assert_eq!(parse_music("o| o| o| o| o| o| o| o| o|"), vec![2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2]);
